        <p><strong>TOPCon Modules —</strong> New generation cell technology that offers superior efficiency and better energy production over their lifetime. Perfect for commercial and industrial high-producing energy enhancements.
</p>
        <p><strong>BIPV (Building-Integrated photovoltaics) —</strong> The architectural, aesthetic module replaces building elements (façades, canopies, roofs) to provide both architectural beauty and energy.
</p>
        <p><strong>What makes us perform well:</strong> Enhanced cell technology, low-loss interconnections, quality Glass/EVA for longevity, and thicker frame and junction box options for high weather and heat cycle commonality in India.
</p>
<h2 class="head2">Solar Structure Manufacturing — Strong Foundations for Long Life</h2>
         
         <p>A reliable PV system starts with a durable structure. As an experienced solar structure manufacturer, Contendre Solar supplies engineered mounting systems for:</p>
