<h2 class="head2">Quality Assurance, Certifications & Testing
</h2>
<p>Quality is core to our manufacturing DNA. Contendre Solar follows a multi-tiered QA regime that includes raw material checks, process audits, intermediate statistical controls, and final acceptance testing (IV curve, EL testing, mechanical load test, PID/UV exposure where applicable).
</p>
<p>We follow national and international standards for PV manufacturing and certifications and have our panels certified to the highest safety, performance, and durability standards. 
</p>
<h2 class="head2">Our End-to-End Process (How We Deliver)</h2>
